hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2851","###\n Ahmad bin Mani' narrated to us, saying: Sufyan narrated to us, from Muhammad bin Abi Harmalah and Ibrahim bin Uqbah, from Kurayb, from Ibn Abbas (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) departed from Arafat, and Usamah (RA) rode behind him. When they reached the valley (Shi'b), he dismounted and urinated, but he did not say, \Pour water.\"" Usamah (RA) said: So I poured water for him from the"""
